# SIH PS26171 — Privacy-Preserving Vision Browser Agent: Complete Architecture & Build Plan

## 1. Executive Summary

Build a **privacy-preserving autonomous browser agent** delivered as a Chrome/Firefox extension (client) + Python server. The client runs lightweight vision & PII models on-device via WebGPU, sanitizes all sensitive data, and sends only anonymized context to the server. The server uses an LLM for planning/reasoning and a VLM for visual grounding, returning structured action commands the extension executes.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Differentiator**: Unlike commercial agents (Perplexity Comet, ChatGPT Atlas), our agent enforces **data-never-leaves-device** for PII — the server literally cannot see sensitive content. This is the core SIH evaluation criteria (40% weight on PII detection + redaction precision).

