### Layer 7: Execution Engine (Action Runner — on Client)

The extension executes structured actions received from the server:

```mermaid
graph TD
    ACTION["Receive Action from Server"] --> CHECK["Protocol Check"]
    CHECK -->|"SAFE"| MODE{"Execution Mode?"}
    CHECK -->|"CRITICAL"| APPROVE["Request User Approval"]
    APPROVE -->|"Approved"| MODE
    APPROVE -->|"Denied"| SKIP["Skip / Manual"]
    
    MODE -->|"DOM"| DOM_EXEC["DOM Executor<br/>(querySelector + dispatch events)"]
    MODE -->|"VISION"| VIS_EXEC["Vision Executor<br/>(coordinate-based click)"]
    MODE -->|"HYBRID"| HYB_EXEC["Try DOM first → fallback to Vision"]
    
    DOM_EXEC --> VERIFY["Verify Action Result"]
    VIS_EXEC --> VERIFY
    HYB_EXEC --> VERIFY
    
    VERIFY -->|"Success"| REPORT["Report to Server"]
    VERIFY -->|"Failed"| RETRY["Self-Correct / Report Error"]
    RETRY --> REPORT
```

