## 5. Structured Action Protocol (Server → Client)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The LLM **never** returns plain English. All responses are structured JSON conforming to this schema.

### Action Schema

```json
{
  "session_id": "sess_abc123",
  "goal": "Find and select headphones under ₹1000 on Flipkart",
  "plan": {
    "total_steps": 5,
    "estimated_time_s": 45,
    "chain_of_thought": "User wants budget headphones. Need to navigate to Flipkart, search, apply price filter, then present options."
  },
  "current_step": {
    "id": 1,
    "action": "NAVIGATE",
    "target": { "url": "https://www.flipkart.com" },
    "execution_mode": "DOM",
    "protocol_level": "SAFE",
    "fallback": { "action": "REPORT_ERROR", "reason": "site_unreachable" },
    "timeout_ms": 10000,
    "verify": {
      "method": "DOM_CHECK",
      "condition": "document.querySelector('input[title=Search]') !== null"
    }
  },
  "task_state": {
    "completed": [],
    "current": 1,
    "remaining": [2, 3, 4, 5],
    "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
  },
  "memory": {
    "context_from_previous": null,
    "key_observations": []
  }
}
```

### Complete Action Vocabulary

| Action | Execution Mode | Description |
|:---|:---|:---|
| `NAVIGATE` | DOM | Open URL in agent tab |
| `CLICK` | DOM / VISION / HYBRID | Click element by selector or coordinates |
| `TYPE` | DOM | Type text into input field |
| `TYPE_FROM_VAULT` | DOM (local only) | Fill from vault — data never sent to server |
| `SCROLL` | DOM | Scroll page/element |
| `SELECT` | DOM | Select dropdown option |
| `WAIT` | — | Wait for element/condition |
| `SCREENSHOT` | — | Capture current state for VLM |
| `EXTRACT` | DOM | Extract data from page |
| `NEW_TAB` | DOM | Open new tab (inherits session) |
| `SWITCH_TAB` | DOM | Switch to another agent tab |
| `CLOSE_TAB` | DOM | Close agent tab |
| `DISMISS_POPUP` | HYBRID | Close modal/popup/ad overlay |
| `CAPTCHA_HANDOFF` | — | Notify user to solve CAPTCHA |
| `APPROVE_ACTION` | — | Request user approval before proceeding |
| `REPORT_RESULT` | — | Return extracted data/status to user |

### Protocol Levels

```json
{
  "protocol_levels": {
    "SAFE": "Agent executes autonomously (navigation, search, scroll, extract)",
    "CAUTION": "Agent notifies user but proceeds unless stopped (form fills, filter changes)",
    "CRITICAL": "Agent MUST get explicit approval (purchases, payments, account changes, deletions, sending messages)",
    "FORBIDDEN": "Agent NEVER executes (financial transactions without approval, deleting accounts, sharing credentials)"
  }
}
```

