## 6. Feature Implementation Details

### 6.1 Credential Vault (Point 12)

```mermaid
graph LR
    USER["User adds credentials"] --> ENCRYPT["AES-256-GCM Encrypt<br/>(browser crypto API)"]
    ENCRYPT --> STORE["chrome.storage.local<br/>(encrypted blob)"]
    
    subgraph "What Server Sees (Page Table)"
        PT["{ name: true, email: true, phone: false, address: true, password: true }"]
    end
    
    subgraph "What Server NEVER Sees"
        RAW["Actual values: 'Aditya', 'aditya@gmail.com', etc."]
    end
    
    STORE -.->|"manifest only"| PT
```

- Server knows **what types** of data are available, never the values
- When server sends `TYPE_FROM_VAULT` action, extension fills locally
- Vault is encrypted with Web Crypto API (AES-256-GCM), key derived from user passphrase

