## 7. Complete Data Flow Pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Extension UI
    participant SW as Service Worker
    participant CS as Content Script
    participant VW as Vision Worker
    participant PW as Privacy Worker
    participant V as Vault
    participant S as Server (LLM+VLM)
    
    U->>UI: "Buy headphones under ₹1000 on Flipkart"
    UI->>SW: Forward query
    
    rect rgb(40, 40, 80)
    Note over SW,PW: Phase 1: Capture Context
    SW->>CS: Request DOM snapshot
    CS-->>SW: Raw DOM tree
    SW->>VW: Request screenshot analysis
    VW-->>SW: Screen state + face BBs
    end
    
    rect rgb(80, 40, 40)
    Note over SW,PW: Phase 2: Sanitize (ALL LOCAL)
    SW->>PW: DOM + screenshot + vision results
    PW->>PW: Regex PII scan on DOM text
    PW->>PW: BERT-NER on DOM text
    PW->>PW: OCR screenshot → NER on extracted text
    PW->>PW: BlackOut faces from BlazeFace BBs
    PW-->>SW: Sanitized DOM + Redacted screenshot + Redaction map
    end
    
    SW->>V: Get vault manifest (keys only, no values)
    V-->>SW: { email: true, password: true, ... }
    
    rect rgb(40, 80, 40)
    Note over SW,S: Phase 3: Server Processing
    SW->>S: { query, sanitized_dom, redacted_screenshot, vault_manifest }
    S->>S: LLM: Parse query → Generate plan (CoT)
    S->>S: VLM: Verify screen state matches plan
    S-->>SW: Structured Action Plan (JSON)
    end
    
    rect rgb(80, 80, 40)
    Note over SW,CS: Phase 4: Execute Actions
    loop For each step
        SW->>CS: Execute action (DOM/VISION/HYBRID)
        CS-->>SW: Result + new DOM snapshot
        SW->>PW: Sanitize new state
        PW-->>SW: Sanitized update
        SW->>S: Step result + updated context
        S-->>SW: Next step / correction / approval request
        
        alt Protocol = CRITICAL
            SW->>UI: Show approval dialog
            U->>UI: Approve / Deny
            UI->>SW: Decision
        end
        
        alt CAPTCHA detected
            SW->>UI: "CAPTCHA detected — please solve manually"
            U->>UI: Solves CAPTCHA
            UI->>SW: Resume
        end
        
        alt Vault data needed
            SW->>UI: "Need email from vault. Allow?"
            U->>UI: Allow vault access
            SW->>V: Get encrypted value
            V-->>SW: Decrypted value (stays local)
            SW->>CS: Fill form locally (value never sent to server)
        end
    end
    end
    
    SW->>UI: Task complete + results
    SW->>S: Update session memory
    Note over U: Desktop notification: "Task completed!"
