| **Accuracy of visual context** | 25% | MobileViT (screen classify) + VLM (Qwen2.5-VL-7B for grounding) + DOM extraction — triple-verified context | High |
| **PII detection recall/precision** | 20% | 4-layer: Regex (structured) + BERT-NER (contextual) + BlazeFace (faces) + Tesseract OCR (text-in-images) | High |
| **Precision of redaction** | 20% | Token-based replacement (reversible), pixel-level blackout for faces, DOM node masking | High |
| **Client resource utilization** | 20% | All models <100 MB total; Web Workers (off main thread); WebGPU acceleration; IndexedDB caching | High |
| **End-to-end latency** | 15% | DOM extraction <50ms; PII scan <300ms; Server round-trip ~2-3s; Total step: ~3-5s | Medium-High |

